[Desktop Entry]
Name=Osiris Dark
Comment=OSIRIS dual-accent window decoration — flat, 6px top corners, cyan focus, rose close-hover
Type=Service
X-KDE-ServiceTypes=KDecoration

[X-KDE-Aurorae]
